&lt;p data-start=&quot;128&quot; data-end=&quot;216&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The YDB Development Team at Nebius is looking for Mid and Senior Software Developer with a strong expertise in C++.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
