&lt;li&gt;Understanding of core dumps, flamegraphs, and sanitized builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing high-performance, low-latency components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of CPU caches, Modern CPU atomic operations and NUMA architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1430&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/p&gt;
